WEBVTT

01:30.270 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 25]

01:39.070 --> 01:40.070
Eighth Master Li.

02:00.460 --> 02:02.480
I brought you the carpentry tools

02:03.970 --> 02:05.290
to kill time,

02:07.900 --> 02:09.669
not for you to ruin the wood.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.030
Yesterday, Jingdong

02:24.470 --> 02:26.329
hung my Sixth Brother's portrait

02:27.070 --> 02:28.620
in the ancestral hall.

02:30.840 --> 02:32.240
When we were young,

02:32.650 --> 02:34.180
he always loved to outdo me.

02:35.340 --> 02:36.140
And I

02:37.840 --> 02:39.840
also thought he was not as good as me.

02:40.410 --> 02:42.030
Looking back now,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.930
my Sixth Brother actually beat me to it

02:46.400 --> 02:47.440
his whole life.

02:48.980 --> 02:51.579
His portrait can be hung
in the ancestral hall,

02:51.590 --> 02:52.590
but what about me?

02:57.030 --> 02:58.560
I am still not as good as him.

02:59.840 --> 03:00.640
But,

03:02.740 --> 03:04.870
on my way back from the ancestral hall,

03:05.280 --> 03:06.310
I kept thinking—

03:08.630 --> 03:10.120
he is already gone,

03:10.820 --> 03:12.590
yet I am still comparing myself to him.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.080
What is the point?

03:19.960 --> 03:21.020
Third Master Chen,

03:22.910 --> 03:23.710
am I right?

03:24.560 --> 03:25.430
Enough.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.910
When your family had an accident
with your Tribute Ink,

03:27.910 --> 03:29.850
you were doing even worse than I am now!

03:29.850 --> 03:31.850
What right do you have to lecture me?

03:32.360 --> 03:34.490
Then how did you persuade me back then?

03:35.820 --> 03:37.820
You said people should look forward

03:38.490 --> 03:41.820
and shouldn't get stuck,
overthinking things in a dead end,

03:41.840 --> 03:42.630
right?

03:43.360 --> 03:45.400
Why are you comparing yourself to me?

03:45.400 --> 03:46.030
Fine,

03:48.400 --> 03:50.130
then let's compare ourselves.

03:50.150 --> 03:51.150
My son is dead.

03:51.180 --> 03:52.340
What about you?

03:54.520 --> 03:56.470
Every time I see Junshan,

03:59.190 --> 04:00.870
I think of my son, Jingfu.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.310
Junshan.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.630
Junshan.

04:16.430 --> 04:17.190
Junshan,

04:18.160 --> 04:20.160
what book were you reading just now?

04:20.240 --> 04:21.240
Eighth Master Li,

04:21.240 --> 04:23.510
I was reading an ancient book
on ink-making.

04:23.510 --> 04:26.240
I want to further my study
of the glue-mixing method.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.970
Why do you want to study it more?

04:32.510 --> 04:34.750
Lately, I've been pondering over it.

04:35.430 --> 04:36.870
During the Tribute Ink selection,

04:36.870 --> 04:39.510
Tian Ink was able to beat our Chen Ink

04:40.480 --> 04:43.190
partly because that Taoist meddled in,

04:43.310 --> 04:44.240
but honestly,

04:44.680 --> 04:46.270
it still came down to the fact
that our Chen Ink

04:46.270 --> 04:48.240
couldn't beat Tian Ink by much.

04:49.630 --> 04:52.000
Tian Ink has Styrax resin.

04:52.750 --> 04:54.890
Our Chen Ink doesn't take that path.

04:55.680 --> 04:57.720
But Chen Ink has its own heritage.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.360
If I

04:59.360 --> 05:01.820
can carry forward our ancestors' heritage,

05:02.040 --> 05:05.510
Chen Ink will be better
than Tian Ink naturally.

05:05.630 --> 05:06.360
I think

05:06.720 --> 05:08.430
no matter who the judge is,

05:08.720 --> 05:11.000
he would have to declare
our Chen Ink the winner.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.920
See?

05:13.830 --> 05:16.490
Even Junshan is more clear-headed
than you are.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.630
Jinhe is gone.

05:18.270 --> 05:19.600
Of us three brothers,

05:20.160 --> 05:21.360
I am the only one left.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.700
The Luo family has no one left.

05:24.090 --> 05:24.990
And the Chen family

05:24.990 --> 05:27.120
only has you, the old man, holding out.

05:27.870 --> 05:29.800
We all have to look forward.

05:32.600 --> 05:34.460
Considering the bigger picture,

05:35.070 --> 05:37.270
we have responsibilities to shoulder.

05:38.240 --> 05:39.570
The Chen and Li families

05:40.040 --> 05:42.000
must not be defeated by anyone.

05:44.830 --> 05:46.290
And personally speaking,

05:47.000 --> 05:47.720
are you really willing

05:47.720 --> 05:50.520
to live the rest of your life
as a complete failure?

05:59.510 --> 06:00.510
Eighth Master Li,

06:02.190 --> 06:03.190
my father...

06:08.800 --> 06:09.480
Jinshui!

06:13.920 --> 06:15.070
Listen carefully.

06:16.190 --> 06:17.190
In two days,

06:17.800 --> 06:20.360
this set of chess pieces will be ready.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.400
When it's complete,

06:22.720 --> 06:23.800
I will beat

06:23.830 --> 06:25.560
with no mercy in Jinhe's place!

06:26.830 --> 06:29.360
Junshan, did you hear that?

06:29.720 --> 06:30.360
Yes.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.270
Good.

06:44.040 --> 06:46.570
The soot produced
by this batch of pine timber

06:46.630 --> 06:48.310
is of really good quality.

06:48.430 --> 06:49.270
Benchang!

06:49.830 --> 06:52.040
Bad news, bad news.

06:52.040 --> 06:52.840
What's wrong?

06:53.600 --> 06:55.390
Right after the Li family
delivered the pine timber,

06:55.390 --> 06:57.830
we dug this up under the tree roots

06:58.310 --> 06:59.600
at the Li pine yard.

07:00.000 --> 07:00.870
What is this?

07:01.560 --> 07:03.040
Rosin oil!

07:03.600 --> 07:06.430
You were tricked by that uruly girl
from the Li family.

07:06.430 --> 07:08.430
Why did they choose Linxi pine yard?

07:09.240 --> 07:10.570
It was exactly for this.

07:11.070 --> 07:13.330
This can replace pine timber
to make ink.

07:16.070 --> 07:16.720
Brother,

07:16.950 --> 07:18.190
for this pine timber,

07:18.240 --> 07:20.160
we've suffered multiple losses!

07:20.560 --> 07:22.430
Can you really let that slide?

07:22.430 --> 07:23.040
Enough!

07:25.750 --> 07:26.310
Father,

07:26.920 --> 07:27.750
you watch the ink workshop.

07:27.750 --> 07:28.480
I'm going out for a bit.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.040
Okay.

07:40.909 --> 07:42.560
Mr. Sheng, I finally found you.

07:42.560 --> 07:43.430
Eldest Young Master Tian.

07:43.430 --> 07:44.190
Without further ado,

07:44.190 --> 07:46.720
I'll pay 100 taels of silver
to buy your pine yard.

07:46.720 --> 07:47.040
Well...

07:47.040 --> 07:48.000
120 taels!

07:48.750 --> 07:49.390
Young Master Tian!

07:49.390 --> 07:51.850
Mr. Sheng, did you
run into an acquaintance?

07:54.070 --> 07:56.830
Isn't this the Eldest Young Master
of the Tian family?

07:56.830 --> 07:58.170
[Contract]

07:56.930 --> 07:58.390
I'll leave you two to it.

07:58.800 --> 08:02.600
But thank you, Mr. Sheng, for transferring
your treasured property to us today.

08:02.600 --> 08:03.240
Farewell.

08:06.720 --> 08:08.240
You teamed up to trick me?

08:27.270 --> 08:28.160
Manager Zhen.

08:28.390 --> 08:29.360
Master Qi,

08:29.510 --> 08:31.170
I was just about to go find you.

08:31.270 --> 08:32.799
Today is an auspicious day.

08:32.870 --> 08:34.600
I was thinking of inviting you
and Mr. Xiao

08:34.600 --> 08:36.840
to go to the Linxi pine yard with me
and start working together.

08:36.840 --> 08:37.480
Good!

08:37.600 --> 08:39.909
But before we go, Manager Zhen,

08:40.150 --> 08:42.150
you have to give me 300 taels of silver.

08:42.150 --> 08:43.750
Give you 300 taels of silver?

08:44.870 --> 08:45.730
Check this out.

08:46.390 --> 08:47.200
What is this?

08:56.220 --> 08:59.620
These are all the pine yards
you've got by singing contracts?

09:01.200 --> 09:02.720
I just planned to have someone

09:02.720 --> 09:04.600
buy the surrounding pine yards.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.670
Didn't expect you, Master Qi...

09:08.270 --> 09:09.270
These days,

09:09.270 --> 09:11.960
seeing you busy
with the family affairs, Manager Zhen,

09:11.960 --> 09:14.890
I couldn't help but think about
what was on your mind.

09:14.910 --> 09:15.360
So I

09:15.360 --> 09:17.320
took a look at all the pine yards

09:17.340 --> 09:18.420
around Huizhou.

09:18.960 --> 09:21.030
These yards have trees of enough age,

09:21.200 --> 09:23.080
and the bosses happened to want to quit.

09:23.080 --> 09:23.840
Therefore,

09:23.840 --> 09:26.320
I negotiated the prices with them.

09:27.150 --> 09:28.480
It's quite a good deal.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.200
I just got a little taste

09:31.720 --> 09:33.550
of what it's like
to be a manager in advance.

09:33.550 --> 09:36.480
But you still have to pay the money.

09:37.750 --> 09:39.030
Master Qi,

09:39.630 --> 09:40.600
well done.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.080
It's all thanks

09:43.360 --> 09:45.160
to your guidance, Manager Zhen.

09:47.880 --> 09:50.430
[Linxi Pine Yard]

09:49.320 --> 09:50.510
Go gently, gently.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.080
We dug it out.

10:03.150 --> 10:04.630
Manager Zhen, Third Master.

10:04.630 --> 10:05.510
Uncle Jingdong.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.840
With the rosin oil here,

10:06.870 --> 10:07.480
plus

10:07.480 --> 10:09.790
that at the pine yards
recently signed by Master Qi,

10:09.790 --> 10:11.550
our ink workshop
won't need to worry about raw materials

10:11.550 --> 10:13.390
for the next 3 to 5 years.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.550
Great!

10:15.440 --> 10:17.120
Doggie, have them dig for it.

10:17.120 --> 10:17.850
Get started!

10:18.640 --> 10:22.570
Guys! Let's start digging for rosin oil!

10:22.600 --> 10:23.440
Got it!

10:23.480 --> 10:24.680
Thank you, everyone!

10:31.440 --> 10:32.440
This one is so big.

10:32.470 --> 10:33.150
Right?

10:33.200 --> 10:35.260
The quality is good, too. Take a look.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.960
Can you hurry up?

11:02.480 --> 11:03.440
Stop playing.

11:04.500 --> 11:06.230
You stick around like a shadow.

11:06.360 --> 11:08.000
I told you not to follow me,

11:08.570 --> 11:09.450
but you insisted on coming.

11:09.450 --> 11:10.510
If we're late

11:10.510 --> 11:11.770
and Aunt gets unhappy,

11:11.960 --> 11:12.870
refusing to teach me glue-mixing,

11:12.870 --> 11:14.120
you'll be in trouble.

11:14.550 --> 11:16.070
Brother, wait for me.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.510
Are you okay?

11:21.440 --> 11:22.700
My butt hurts a little.

11:22.790 --> 11:23.790
Serves you right.

11:23.870 --> 11:24.440
Get on.

11:27.910 --> 11:28.740
Brother.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.790
Aunt is not married.

11:30.910 --> 11:33.000
Why doesn't she live with us?

11:33.320 --> 11:34.790
Why does she have to live

11:34.790 --> 11:36.450
in this empty Linxi pine yard?

11:37.030 --> 11:39.600
Because Aunt
looks after all our pine yards.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.670
It's convenient for her
to do it living here.

11:41.670 --> 11:42.870
You're lying.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.510
I heard Ping'an say

11:44.670 --> 11:46.030
that Father wanted Aunt to go home

11:46.030 --> 11:48.150
to help prepare
for the Tribute Ink selection,

11:48.150 --> 11:49.440
but Aunt refused

11:49.630 --> 11:51.430
and even had a fight with Father.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.320
She must have been mad at Father,

11:53.440 --> 11:54.000
so she moved out.

11:54.000 --> 11:55.670
What do you know, little brat?

11:56.120 --> 11:58.320
Watch your mouth when we see Aunt later.

12:14.440 --> 12:15.240
Brother.

13:58.270 --> 14:00.390
Aunt, what is this?

14:00.670 --> 14:01.670
This?

14:02.360 --> 14:03.670
It's called amber.

14:04.120 --> 14:06.440
It's pine resin
dripping down from the pine tree,

14:06.440 --> 14:08.600
wrapping leaves or insects,

14:08.870 --> 14:10.510
and buried underground for many years

14:10.510 --> 14:12.510
before it became what it is now.

14:12.870 --> 14:15.200
How many years do you mean
by "many years"?

14:15.550 --> 14:18.910
"Once an ancient tuckahoe,
originally the pine liquid,

14:19.270 --> 14:23.870
with falling mosquitoes inside, it shows
everything vividly even after 1,000 years."

14:23.870 --> 14:25.720
It takes at least 1,000 years.

14:25.910 --> 14:28.200
A-A thousand years?

14:29.510 --> 14:30.600
If you like it,

14:30.630 --> 14:32.690
Aunt will give it to you. Is that good?

14:42.750 --> 14:45.200
Wenqian, have some snacks.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.440
This is Weighing Rod-Shaped Candy,

14:49.600 --> 14:52.130
and this is usnea tea
with pine needles added.

14:52.270 --> 14:53.870
You haven't been back for a while.

14:53.870 --> 14:55.550
I guess you haven't tasted

14:55.550 --> 14:57.440
these hometown foods.

14:57.510 --> 14:58.550
Thank you, Aunt.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.030
Aunt,

15:06.030 --> 15:07.560
I like it more in your place.

15:07.750 --> 15:09.320
Father never plays with me.

15:09.550 --> 15:11.210
He only wants me to study hard,

15:11.390 --> 15:13.080
get a position
through the imperial examination,

15:13.080 --> 15:15.410
and earn the Luo family greater prestige.

15:15.630 --> 15:16.390
Wenqian,

15:17.230 --> 15:18.960
it is good for you to study hard.

15:19.480 --> 15:21.120
You should focus on your studies

15:21.120 --> 15:22.320
and grow up well.

15:22.960 --> 15:24.010
When you grow up,

15:24.030 --> 15:26.760
you can decide
what to do in the future on your own.

15:27.000 --> 15:28.080
Then,

15:28.360 --> 15:30.420
will I not have to listen to my father?

15:30.750 --> 15:31.750
That's not right.

15:31.910 --> 15:34.030
You still have to listen to your father.

15:34.030 --> 15:35.320
However, this time,

15:35.980 --> 15:38.510
I didn't listen
to your father either, right?

15:40.750 --> 15:42.810
Try this Weighing Rod-Shaped Candy.

15:48.550 --> 15:49.510
It's delicious.

16:12.880 --> 16:16.340
Why are you zoning out, staring
at the thatched cottage alone?

16:16.840 --> 16:18.440
I was surprised by this, too,

16:18.910 --> 16:20.510
so I came to take a look.

16:20.790 --> 16:23.030
This thatched cottage looks quite old.

16:26.030 --> 16:29.000
I guess it should be the place
where the pine keeper

16:29.000 --> 16:30.330
of the Luo family lived.

16:35.390 --> 16:37.390
Although this cottage is decrepit,

16:37.630 --> 16:39.670
if it is renovated properly,

16:40.320 --> 16:42.320
living here

16:43.030 --> 16:44.910
would be an amazing experience.

16:47.200 --> 16:49.240
I never thought a worldly person like you

16:49.240 --> 16:52.640
would actually have the idea
of living in a secluded cottage.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.120
No.

16:54.790 --> 16:56.000
I mean,

16:56.200 --> 16:57.960
if we buy this place,

16:58.360 --> 17:00.600
if there are important guests
to take a look at the pine forest,

17:00.600 --> 17:03.120
there will be a place
to have some tea and take a rest,

17:03.120 --> 17:03.720
right?

17:05.750 --> 17:06.859
But what a pity.

17:08.030 --> 17:10.160
I am penniless now.

17:10.680 --> 17:12.750
When I make a comeback one day,

17:12.750 --> 17:14.640
I will definitely buy this place.

17:15.000 --> 17:15.589
Huh?

17:23.200 --> 17:24.660
Here, for you to play with.

17:26.750 --> 17:27.609
I have one, too.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.030
Mine is bigger.

17:29.920 --> 17:31.580
Forget it if you don't want it.

17:32.240 --> 17:33.200
I've warmed it for quite a while.

17:33.200 --> 17:34.240
Mine is warmer.

17:39.030 --> 17:39.830
Master Qi,

17:40.390 --> 17:42.370
concerning the pine yards this time,

17:42.370 --> 17:43.780
you did a great job.

17:44.350 --> 17:45.240
So I was thinking of

17:45.240 --> 17:47.700
giving you a small reward.
What do you think?

17:49.360 --> 17:50.680
A small reward?

17:51.750 --> 17:52.400
Good.

17:52.960 --> 17:54.880
Every little bit counts.

17:55.030 --> 17:56.920
Tell me about this small reward.

17:57.590 --> 17:59.160
The Li Ink's pine yards used to be

17:59.160 --> 18:01.020
managed by my Sixth Grandfather.

18:01.270 --> 18:02.720
Now that he is gone,

18:03.160 --> 18:05.290
I was thinking of putting you in charge

18:05.590 --> 18:06.830
of the pine yards.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.350
In the future, when you are upset,

18:09.350 --> 18:11.310
you can rest in this thatched cottage.

18:11.310 --> 18:12.040
How about it?

18:21.310 --> 18:22.030
For real?

18:22.270 --> 18:23.240
For real.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.460
But I don't have a contract right now.

18:27.550 --> 18:30.640
So let's use
this pine resin ball as a witness.

18:30.920 --> 18:31.590
It's a deal.

18:32.200 --> 18:32.720
Yeah,

18:33.160 --> 18:33.960
it's a deal.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.680
You crushed it.

18:36.880 --> 18:38.810
Just squeeze it, and it'll be fine.

18:43.200 --> 18:43.830
Zhen.

18:46.640 --> 18:47.310
Thank you.

18:54.750 --> 18:55.550
How about

18:56.680 --> 18:58.510
we draw up

18:59.830 --> 19:01.110
a contract later?

19:07.880 --> 19:08.740
It's a promise.

19:09.030 --> 19:10.680
Deal. It's a deal.

19:17.350 --> 19:18.960
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

19:18.960 --> 19:19.720
Thank you.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.310
Thank you.

19:22.070 --> 19:23.000
Uncle Jingdong,

19:23.270 --> 19:24.670
let's unveil the plaque.

19:26.710 --> 19:29.480
Some guests haven't arrived yet.
Let's wait a bit more.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.880
Who else hasn't arrived?

19:34.550 --> 19:35.410
Here they come.

19:37.000 --> 19:37.750
Jingdong!

19:40.790 --> 19:42.400
Mother, Grandfather,

19:42.680 --> 19:44.110
Zhengliang, Sister-in-law,

19:44.110 --> 19:45.070
what brings you here?

19:45.070 --> 19:46.750
-Eighth Master Li.
-Eighth Master Li.

19:46.750 --> 19:48.480
We didn't want to come at first.

19:49.510 --> 19:52.640
Your Third Aunt went
to City Gate Lane early this morning

19:52.680 --> 19:54.540
and insisted on inviting us over.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.640
Yes, yes.

19:55.640 --> 19:57.570
Thank you for making the trip, Jin.

19:58.030 --> 19:58.790
Jingdong,

19:59.160 --> 20:01.440
I talked my head off and dragged

20:01.510 --> 20:03.750
Jin and the others here for you.

20:04.480 --> 20:05.350
Today

20:05.750 --> 20:08.200
is the day Li Ink rises again.

20:08.960 --> 20:11.270
I specially invited Eighth Uncle

20:12.200 --> 20:14.200
and everyone from the Eighth Branch

20:14.790 --> 20:16.790
back to unveil the plaque together.

20:18.510 --> 20:19.350
Eighth Uncle,

20:21.790 --> 20:23.120
Second Sister-in-law.

20:24.270 --> 20:26.510
I have been so stubborn.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.550
For so many years,

20:29.270 --> 20:31.270
I trapped myself in my narrow world,

20:31.270 --> 20:33.270
disregarding the Li family's fate.

20:33.440 --> 20:34.440
I also repeatedly

20:34.830 --> 20:36.230
made things hard for Zhen

20:36.720 --> 20:37.980
and the Eighth Branch.

20:38.830 --> 20:39.920
Here, I'd like

20:41.790 --> 20:43.120
to apologize to you all.

20:44.640 --> 20:45.310
Jingdong!

20:46.480 --> 20:48.210
Jingdong, it's all in the past.

20:50.510 --> 20:51.550
It's over now.

20:52.920 --> 20:53.780
Third Brother,

20:54.590 --> 20:56.790
let's forget about the past.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.030
Zhen,

21:05.680 --> 21:07.240
I burned down the ink workshop.

21:07.240 --> 21:09.200
I'm too ashamed

21:09.400 --> 21:12.000
and too unqualified to unveil this plaque.

21:13.270 --> 21:16.110
Li Ink can restart
making lampblack and ink,

21:16.720 --> 21:18.980
all thanks to your great contributions.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.270
This plaque

21:20.920 --> 21:23.780
should be unveiled by you,
the Head of the Workshop.

21:44.680 --> 21:45.590
Li Ink!

21:46.680 --> 21:47.790
Unveil the plaque!

21:49.190 --> 21:50.740
[Li Ink]

21:51.440 --> 21:52.960
-Bravo!
-Nice!

22:12.960 --> 22:15.110
Mother, did you see

22:15.350 --> 22:16.960
the plaque inscription today?

22:16.960 --> 22:20.510
That plaque was personally inscribed
by Mr. Dongtu.

22:20.550 --> 22:23.110
It's the one and only
among Huizhou ink workshops.

22:23.110 --> 22:24.030
In my opinion,

22:24.070 --> 22:27.680
no matter whose calligraphy it is,
it's not as impressive

22:27.830 --> 22:30.160
as how you looked
when unveiling the plaque.

22:30.160 --> 22:30.880
Zhen.

22:31.070 --> 22:32.070
You may not know.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.070
Mother started preparing

22:33.070 --> 22:35.310
this Mid-Autumn Festival dinner
last night.

22:35.310 --> 22:37.790
Winter bamboo shoots with ham,
steamed pork with rice flour,

22:37.790 --> 22:38.790
and arrowroot dumplings.

22:38.790 --> 22:39.480
And also

22:39.480 --> 22:41.240
your favorite rock tripe and chicken soup,

22:41.240 --> 22:42.310
Mother made a huge pot of it.

22:42.310 --> 22:43.240
Yes, yes.

22:44.880 --> 22:46.480
Every Mid-Autumn Festival,

22:46.510 --> 22:49.440
the main family invites
the master ink makers of the ink workshop

22:49.440 --> 22:51.000
to a banquet.

22:51.310 --> 22:54.720
The managers toast them to celebrate.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.310
Zhen,

22:59.350 --> 23:00.640
during the hardest years
for the Li family,

23:00.640 --> 23:03.790
it was those masters
who stayed by our side to pull through.

23:03.790 --> 23:06.480
Now is the time to really celebrate.

23:06.640 --> 23:08.830
As the manager, you can't be absent.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.750
So, go and celebrate

23:10.750 --> 23:11.880
with them properly.

23:13.550 --> 23:14.270
Mother,

23:14.440 --> 23:15.750
Grandfather, Zhengliang, Qiu'e,

23:15.750 --> 23:16.790
I just calculated it.

23:16.790 --> 23:18.960
There's still an hour
before the Li family's banquet starts.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.000
So I've still got time

23:20.000 --> 23:21.880
to drink 3 bowls of chicken soup.

23:21.880 --> 23:22.240
Let's go.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.400
You know what?
With one less mouth to feed,

23:23.400 --> 23:24.440
that drumstick will be left
for your brother.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.590
Zhengliang, Qiu'e,

23:25.640 --> 23:27.720
let's have a race. Whoever gets home first

23:27.720 --> 23:29.070
can have the drumstick.
How about that?

23:29.070 --> 23:30.160
Come on! Run!

23:31.110 --> 23:32.970
Hurry up, Grandfather. Let's go.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.680
-You guys run.
-Hurry up!

23:34.680 --> 23:35.270
Zhengliang.

23:35.270 --> 23:36.000
No!

23:36.920 --> 23:37.750
Get back here!

23:37.750 --> 23:39.610
Mother has something to tell you.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.720
Eldest Aunt, here's a toast to you.

24:22.720 --> 24:23.650
Uncle Jingdong.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.110
Third Aunt.

24:28.440 --> 24:29.310
Drink less.

24:32.030 --> 24:32.830
Manager Zhen,

24:33.200 --> 24:34.770
you are a great contributor.

24:34.770 --> 24:35.560
Steward Shao.

24:35.560 --> 24:36.360
A toast to you.

24:36.720 --> 24:37.520
Okay, thanks.

24:37.750 --> 24:38.210
Well...

24:43.200 --> 24:43.720
Pour it.

24:44.720 --> 24:47.160
You two masters have worked hard lately.

24:48.350 --> 24:49.750
Thank you, Manager Zhen.

24:55.240 --> 24:55.830
Come on.

24:55.830 --> 24:56.590
Let me pour for you.

24:56.590 --> 24:57.650
Let me pour for you.

25:04.240 --> 25:06.240
Manager Zhen,
thank you for your hard work.

25:06.240 --> 25:06.790
A toast to you.

25:06.790 --> 25:09.590
You two have worked hard, too,
so don't mention it.

25:12.790 --> 25:14.190
Thank you, Manager Zhen.

25:17.930 --> 25:19.080
Drink less.

25:19.440 --> 25:20.400
I know.

25:22.200 --> 25:22.640
Come on.

25:22.640 --> 25:23.750
Pick up your glasses.

25:23.750 --> 25:24.510
Alright, cheers.

25:24.510 --> 25:25.640
Come on, Master Qi,

25:25.660 --> 25:26.460
a toast to you.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.480
Oh, my goodness,

25:37.370 --> 25:40.170
we hurried all the way
yet only caught the tail end.

25:40.610 --> 25:42.490
I was wondering why the great Manager Zhen

25:42.490 --> 25:45.090
would sneak away halfway
through the banquet.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.640
Don't talk nonsense.

25:46.640 --> 25:47.970
I wasn't sneaking away.

25:48.160 --> 25:49.790
You saw it yourself just now.

25:49.960 --> 25:51.680
Everyone was toasting me.

25:51.790 --> 25:54.320
If I drank any more,
I would have gotten drunk.

25:54.880 --> 25:56.310
I promised my mother

25:56.550 --> 25:58.610
that I wouldn't drink too much today.

26:03.790 --> 26:04.830
So beautiful!

26:06.350 --> 26:07.280
Did you see that?

26:07.720 --> 26:08.400
I saw it.

26:21.780 --> 26:25.530
♪ Raindrops fall on
the moss-covered stone steps ♪

26:23.200 --> 26:24.600
Why are you bullying him?

26:24.750 --> 26:25.750
It's none of your business!

26:25.750 --> 26:27.880
This little beggar broke my fish lantern.

26:25.960 --> 26:30.000
♪ With a bamboo knife,
you make the spring fade away ♪

26:28.400 --> 26:29.960
I thought it was something serious.

26:29.960 --> 26:30.750
Take mine.

26:30.310 --> 26:32.830
♪ Last year's branches are still
hanging in the window ♪

26:30.790 --> 26:32.240
Don't hit him anymore.

26:33.030 --> 26:39.500
♪ The tea left a stain on the sleeve ♪

26:40.090 --> 26:44.040
♪ The wreathing smoke
gradually dissipated ♪

26:44.070 --> 26:48.370
♪ Counting the games of our childhood ♪

26:48.630 --> 26:51.240
♪ You lower your eyes
and count the rings of the tree ♪

26:51.270 --> 26:51.880
Qi Jiu...

26:51.460 --> 26:57.090
♪ Scars meander like a stream ♪

26:54.830 --> 26:55.640
Where is he?

27:02.570 --> 27:07.210
♪ The ink-black distant mountains
resemble your eyes and brows ♪

27:07.750 --> 27:12.180
♪ Amid the inky darkness,
it seems as though a galaxy is shifting ♪

27:08.550 --> 27:09.830
Where did you just go?

27:10.070 --> 27:13.960
They all say the fireworks
and fish lanterns are a must-see

27:12.320 --> 27:16.390
♪ Lend me a bit of
the courage of a piece of pine resin ♪

27:14.400 --> 27:16.200
on the Mid-Autumn Festival in Huizhou.

27:16.200 --> 27:19.510
Even though we only caught the tail end,

27:16.410 --> 27:20.680
♪ Amid the frost,
I sketch the unfinished prologue ♪

27:19.680 --> 27:20.960
we can't miss out on this.

27:20.820 --> 27:25.710
♪ The hazy, distant mountains
are just like you ♪

27:23.480 --> 27:24.200
Thank you.

27:26.080 --> 27:30.560
♪ A winding bridge
reflected in the water pavilion ♪

27:28.070 --> 27:28.960
Pretty, right?

27:29.480 --> 27:30.350
Pretty.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.240
Really pretty.

27:31.590 --> 27:34.960
♪ If we are to part ways ♪

27:35.170 --> 27:43.210
♪ Let the ink speak for me and say,
"Take care" ♪

27:42.880 --> 27:45.070
Do you want to play something
even more fun?

27:45.070 --> 27:45.920
What is it?

27:46.310 --> 27:47.570
Harvest Eve Foraging.

27:48.960 --> 27:49.490
Let's go!

27:50.380 --> 27:53.180
I'll take you to experience
Harvest Eve Foraging.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.350
Why are you following me?

28:05.350 --> 28:06.310
During Harvest Eve Foraging,

28:06.310 --> 28:07.400
we each take our own.

28:07.400 --> 28:08.510
Let's see who gets a bigger one.

28:08.510 --> 28:10.070
Go away. Don't follow me.

28:10.400 --> 28:12.200
You do the Harvest Eve Foraging,

28:12.400 --> 28:13.930
and I'll keep watch for you.

28:15.110 --> 28:15.960
Keep watch?

28:16.340 --> 28:17.960
You sound quite experienced.

28:17.960 --> 28:19.020
Someone taught me.

28:19.830 --> 28:20.510
Who?

28:21.960 --> 28:22.680
No one.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.240
I'll go

28:24.400 --> 28:25.200
over there.

29:00.410 --> 29:01.570
Look! Over there!

29:02.930 --> 29:03.770
It's so big.

29:25.790 --> 29:26.440
How about this one?

29:26.440 --> 29:27.270
This is so big.

29:27.310 --> 29:28.170
Not bad, right?

29:29.480 --> 29:30.540
Who's in the field?

29:31.400 --> 29:32.270
Come on, take it.

29:32.270 --> 29:32.830
Okay.

29:34.680 --> 29:35.070
Run!

29:35.070 --> 29:35.720
Let's run.

29:35.720 --> 29:36.160
Run!

29:39.830 --> 29:40.590
Stop! Stop right there!

29:40.590 --> 29:41.350
Hurry!

29:41.590 --> 29:42.440
Stop running!

29:42.830 --> 29:43.550
Stop there!

29:43.680 --> 29:44.440
Let's go.

29:44.440 --> 29:45.310
Wait, wait.

29:45.310 --> 29:46.110
I can't see anything!

29:46.110 --> 29:46.750
It's fine.

29:46.750 --> 29:47.350
I can't see.

29:47.350 --> 29:48.160
Here, here, here!

29:48.160 --> 29:50.090
Go across that small stone bridge!

29:51.310 --> 29:51.920
Come on.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.880
Be careful. Take it slow.

29:56.590 --> 29:58.160
Hurry. Come on.

29:59.720 --> 30:00.980
Don't let me catch you!

30:06.110 --> 30:07.310
I just don't get it.

30:07.720 --> 30:09.510
Why is it that every time
I do Harvest Eve Foraging,

30:09.510 --> 30:11.030
I run into these farmers?

30:11.310 --> 30:12.350
Logically speaking,

30:12.350 --> 30:14.160
Harvest Eve Foraging on Mid-Autumn Festival
isn't considered theft.

30:14.160 --> 30:16.160
But why doesn't it work for me?

30:16.400 --> 30:17.880
Alright, stop complaining.

30:17.880 --> 30:21.010
This isn't the first or second time
I've fallen for this.

30:21.270 --> 30:21.960
Pardon?

30:23.830 --> 30:25.720
I said, coming out with you
to do Harvest Eve Foraging

30:25.720 --> 30:27.310
is so much fun.

30:28.750 --> 30:30.610
He didn't catch up with us, right?

30:31.350 --> 30:32.750
Fool, stop peeping.

30:33.210 --> 30:33.970
Let's go.

30:34.000 --> 30:34.730
Didn't you want to rest?

30:34.730 --> 30:35.730
Let's go quickly.

30:41.510 --> 30:42.310
Honestly,

30:42.680 --> 30:45.080
it's been a while
since I felt this relaxed.

30:46.200 --> 30:47.070
Usually at Li Ink,

30:47.070 --> 30:48.750
I have to act like a manager,

30:49.590 --> 30:51.720
being serious with everyone

30:52.000 --> 30:53.200
and putting on airs.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.750
It's exhausting.

30:56.030 --> 30:58.640
Today is the happiest day I've ever had

30:59.640 --> 31:00.830
in such a long time.

31:02.000 --> 31:03.260
I'm glad you're happy.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.570
What was that sound?

31:10.550 --> 31:11.510
Are you hungry?

31:12.270 --> 31:13.350
No wonder.

31:13.550 --> 31:15.310
You barely ate at the banquet.

31:15.480 --> 31:16.810
You were just drinking.

31:17.920 --> 31:18.960
How about this?

31:18.960 --> 31:20.270
I'll smash this pumpkin open for you,

31:20.270 --> 31:21.530
and you can grab a bite.

31:22.440 --> 31:23.200
Come on.

31:23.240 --> 31:24.480
Smash both of them open for me.

31:24.480 --> 31:25.350
Let me see

31:25.480 --> 31:26.810
how you smash them open.

31:29.350 --> 31:30.750
Don't underestimate me.

31:38.680 --> 31:40.160
I brought you a mooncake.

31:40.440 --> 31:40.970
Where did

31:41.400 --> 31:43.240
you conjure that from?

31:46.400 --> 31:47.550
To be honest,

31:47.880 --> 31:50.000
when I left home earlier,

31:51.070 --> 31:52.750
I brought one mooncake, too.

31:53.590 --> 31:55.310
So I prepared this for nothing.

31:55.310 --> 31:56.750
Let's swap.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.640
Okay.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.750
Since you kept me company to have fun

32:02.750 --> 32:04.080
and made me happy today,

32:04.510 --> 32:05.960
take this as a thank you

32:06.070 --> 32:07.160
and your dividend.

32:09.200 --> 32:10.880
My dividend is just this?

32:12.510 --> 32:13.350
What?

32:14.240 --> 32:15.160
Not enough?

32:15.440 --> 32:17.110
This is a huge dividend.

32:17.830 --> 32:18.590
Thank you.

32:24.590 --> 32:26.590
But I really need to thank you.

32:28.550 --> 32:31.000
When I was most helpless and lost,

32:31.480 --> 32:32.680
you took me in

32:33.240 --> 32:34.550
and gave me a job.

32:36.640 --> 32:37.720
Even though

32:38.440 --> 32:40.370
I've had nothing during this time,

32:40.440 --> 32:42.300
I feel like I don't lack anything.

32:42.510 --> 32:43.400
I feel at peace.

32:45.440 --> 32:47.840
And you also sleep well
every night, right?

32:47.880 --> 32:49.340
I didn't lie to you, right?

32:49.440 --> 32:50.830
Smelling the ink

32:51.000 --> 32:53.400
helps you sleep soundly

32:53.480 --> 32:54.680
because this ink

32:54.680 --> 32:57.440
contains pearl powder,
borneol, and sandalwood

32:57.480 --> 32:59.720
to calm and soothe the nerves.

32:59.830 --> 33:01.110
And the ink also has...

33:01.110 --> 33:02.640
It's not because of the ink.

33:04.030 --> 33:05.310
Then what is it?

33:08.000 --> 33:09.000
It's because...

33:15.350 --> 33:16.310
Your dividend.

33:17.600 --> 33:18.490
Eat it up.

33:21.590 --> 33:24.110
Why not? I want the dividends.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.670
Darling,

34:24.320 --> 34:25.920
although the wind in Huizhou

34:26.630 --> 34:28.760
is different from that of the East Sea,

34:31.440 --> 34:32.840
the moon is

34:34.590 --> 34:36.550
just as bright and pure

34:37.630 --> 34:39.159
as the one over the East Sea.

34:55.150 --> 34:57.080
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

34:59.110 --> 35:00.550
Here's a toast to you.

35:31.030 --> 35:32.030
Darling,

35:34.590 --> 35:35.760
I am doing great.

35:37.840 --> 35:38.960
Don't worry.

36:45.670 --> 36:46.360
Please.

36:47.550 --> 36:48.480
You're back!

36:48.480 --> 36:48.960
We're back.

36:48.960 --> 36:49.710
How did it go?

36:49.960 --> 36:51.030
Manager Zhen.

36:52.550 --> 36:53.880
According to your instructions,

36:53.880 --> 36:55.740
at today's new ink testing event,

36:55.930 --> 36:57.850
Master Qi gave an eloquent speech,

36:57.850 --> 37:00.360
recommending our new ink
made with rosin oil.

37:00.360 --> 37:02.480
The students were thrilled,

37:02.480 --> 37:04.150
praising our ink one after another,
saying that

37:04.150 --> 37:06.880
the color is black and smooth enough,
and it's a real bargain.

37:06.880 --> 37:08.150
Asking Lord Yan to invite

37:08.150 --> 37:11.070
the Education Official
to test the ink was a brilliant idea.

37:11.070 --> 37:13.000
After the Education Official
tried the ink,

37:13.000 --> 37:15.550
he thought highly of our new ink.

37:15.960 --> 37:17.590
Not only did he praise it a lot,

37:17.590 --> 37:19.520
but he also bestowed a name upon it.

37:19.800 --> 37:20.530
Check it out.

37:24.110 --> 37:25.110
Shize?

37:26.720 --> 37:29.960
Previously, the academies in Huizhou
used Tribute Ink as an excuse

37:29.960 --> 37:32.470
to force students to buy Styrax resin ink.

37:32.840 --> 37:35.710
But with the recommendation
from the Education Official,

37:35.710 --> 37:36.880
these academy tutors

37:36.880 --> 37:39.280
turned to place orders
for our ink instead.

37:39.550 --> 37:41.800
Even the one who is very close
to the Tian family,

37:41.800 --> 37:42.630
Mr. Zhang,

37:42.710 --> 37:44.460
also showed respect
to the Education Official

37:44.460 --> 37:46.110
and placed an order on the spot.

37:46.110 --> 37:48.920
This way, our Li Ink
has received dozens of orders.

37:50.400 --> 37:51.880
Thank you for your hard work, both of you.

37:51.880 --> 37:53.590
You did well, Master Qi.

37:55.670 --> 37:58.360
"A volume of Lulin Classic
passed down for generations

37:58.360 --> 38:01.760
will lead straight
to high official posts (Shi) and wealth."

38:02.030 --> 38:05.000
"Benefiting (ze) the people." "Shize Ink."

38:05.880 --> 38:06.840
What a good name!

38:07.760 --> 38:10.000
The Education Official put
a profound meaning into it.

38:10.000 --> 38:12.510
Now we not only have received more orders,

38:12.550 --> 38:14.590
but also got the recommendation
from the Education Official.

38:14.590 --> 38:15.800
Li Ink

38:16.190 --> 38:17.760
finally got over this crisis.

38:17.760 --> 38:19.440
This is the blessing for Li Ink.

38:19.440 --> 38:22.840
Every obstacle is hard to overcome,
yet each one is overcome.

38:22.960 --> 38:24.690
You're really a sweet-talker.

38:33.590 --> 38:36.880
Brother, I hope you can realize
your mistake, return the pine timber,

38:36.880 --> 38:39.230
and make peace
with the Li family and Zhen.

38:41.740 --> 38:42.960
Well done, Ronghua,

38:43.510 --> 38:44.710
my "good" sister.

38:45.770 --> 38:47.510
She is getting more and more arrogant now.

38:47.510 --> 38:48.920
How dare she lecture me?

38:49.190 --> 38:49.880
Brother,

38:50.120 --> 38:51.040
Ronghua is now

38:51.060 --> 38:53.230
serving Sage Qing He, after all.

38:53.550 --> 38:56.150
If she gossips willfully
and stirs up trouble,

38:56.210 --> 38:57.860
we'll be in trouble.

38:57.890 --> 38:59.490
What's there to be afraid of?

39:07.760 --> 39:10.220
Even if she's good
at flattering superiors,

39:10.670 --> 39:12.330
she is just a woman, after all.

39:12.670 --> 39:15.530
How can she understand
the Sage's true intentions?

39:15.840 --> 39:18.240
All the bustling
in the world is for profit.

39:18.960 --> 39:21.360
Qing He gave us the title of Tribute Ink.

39:21.840 --> 39:24.170
How could he let it go
without some return?

39:25.380 --> 39:27.370
From now on, if Ronghua writes again
with this nonsense,

39:27.370 --> 39:28.700
just don't show it to me.

39:29.400 --> 39:30.030
Yes.

39:32.840 --> 39:34.760
And there's no need
to pass it on to our parents either.

39:34.760 --> 39:35.440
Okay.

39:37.110 --> 39:38.310
Eldest Young Master,

39:38.400 --> 39:40.460
Mr. Zhang is waiting in the main hall.

39:47.670 --> 39:49.840
The Li family's Shize Ink is

39:47.800 --> 39:49.270
[Shize Ink]

39:50.270 --> 39:52.070
affordable and of high quality,

39:52.190 --> 39:55.260
with the Education Official's
personal recommendation.

39:55.260 --> 39:58.520
The students are also responding
very enthusiastically.

39:58.990 --> 40:00.430
As tutors,

40:01.170 --> 40:03.140
we are caught in the middle.

40:05.030 --> 40:07.440
What are you trying to say, Mr. Zhang?

40:08.280 --> 40:09.110
Manager Tian,

40:09.510 --> 40:11.230
I'd like to call off

40:11.920 --> 40:13.070
our previous deal.

40:13.550 --> 40:14.480
Mr. Zhang,

40:14.590 --> 40:17.050
it's so indecent
to go back on your own words.

40:27.670 --> 40:28.800
Mr. Zhang,

40:29.280 --> 40:30.510
please be patient.

40:32.110 --> 40:33.970
Just let them gloat for a few days.

40:34.000 --> 40:36.000
I will handle this matter.

40:37.110 --> 40:39.000
In a few days, I will deliver the goods

40:39.000 --> 40:40.460
to your academy in person.

40:40.760 --> 40:43.020
I promise you'll be satisfied with them.

40:46.280 --> 40:47.150
Then I will

40:47.440 --> 40:48.920
wait for your good news.

40:50.360 --> 40:51.420
I'll take my leave.

40:51.510 --> 40:52.280
Take care.

41:01.840 --> 41:02.960
It's Li Zhen again.

41:05.440 --> 41:06.440
Jingqi.

41:09.440 --> 41:10.920
When you returned,

41:12.130 --> 41:14.990
they didn't even
put a pair of shoes on you properly.

41:15.710 --> 41:17.480
It was late autumn.

41:18.340 --> 41:19.820
You were barefoot.

41:20.800 --> 41:22.260
You must have felt so cold.

41:29.070 --> 41:30.110
Look,

41:31.710 --> 41:33.770
these are the new shoes I made for you.

41:35.150 --> 41:36.590
Look at my embroidery.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.880
Has it improved a bit?

41:49.590 --> 41:50.440
Third Aunt.

42:00.800 --> 42:01.630
Third Aunt,

42:02.650 --> 42:04.800
I have come to see you several times
over the years,

42:04.800 --> 42:06.260
but you always avoided me.

42:06.920 --> 42:07.920
I thought

42:08.400 --> 42:10.690
your heart had truly been set
on the Li family.

42:10.690 --> 42:12.370
Forget about the past.

42:14.000 --> 42:16.130
Since I asked you to come today

42:16.400 --> 42:18.000
and you were willing to come,

42:18.760 --> 42:20.880
it proves that we share the same goal.

42:21.670 --> 42:23.600
Then what is your goal, Third Aunt?

42:26.800 --> 42:28.660
To kick Li Zhen out of the Li family

42:29.800 --> 42:31.230
and make the Eighth Branch

42:31.230 --> 42:33.160
never get back on their feet again.

42:35.480 --> 42:37.210
So we indeed have the same goal.

42:38.000 --> 42:39.800
If we want to get this done,

42:40.000 --> 42:41.860
you must listen to me completely.

42:47.590 --> 42:49.630
Tomorrow, go to Suzhou

42:50.230 --> 42:54.000
and find a mother and son for me.

42:58.510 --> 42:59.320
No problem.

43:00.500 --> 43:01.960
I am at your command.
